# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxkbcommon
pkgver=1.7.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Keyboard handling for Wayland compositors and apps"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://xkbcommon.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc xkeyboard-config wayland)
source=("https://xkbcommon.org/download/libxkbcommon-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('65782f0a10a4b455af9c6baab7040e2f537520caa2ec2092805cdfd36863b247')

build() {
    # Wayland only; no X11 support yet, and no layout registry (it needs libxml2)
    meson setup libxkbcommon-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D enable-x11=false -D enable-docs=false -D enable-xkbregistry=false \
        -D enable-wayland=true -D enable-tools=true
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
